# Cursor Rules — Parent's Portal System

## Read CLAUDE.md first

`CLAUDE.md` in the repo root is the single source of truth for this project.
Read it before answering anything about architecture, features, or current
state. Do not duplicate its contents here — if this file and CLAUDE.md ever
disagree, CLAUDE.md wins.

## Non-negotiables

- **Trust the code, not the docs.** `PROJECT_PROGRESS.md` overstates progress.
  It lists modules as done that have tables only and no handlers. Verify
  against actual route files before claiming anything works.

- **The auth module is the template.** Every new module follows the exact
  pattern in `routes/users.js`: `authenticate` + `authorize()`,
  `sanitizeUser()` on any response containing a user row, `logActivity()` on
  every write. Do not invent a new structure.

- **Never take `role` or `student_id` from the client.** Both come from the
  database row. `role` from `users.role`, `student_id` from
  `users.student_id`. Not from `req.body`, not from a URL param.

- **Stack is locked.** React + Tailwind + Font Awesome for web. React Native
  (Expo) for mobile. No other UI library, no PWA, no Flutter. `server/` and
  `client/` stay separate — no monorepo tooling.

- **Grades module is blocked.** Grading periods, components, and weights are
  unconfirmed pending a school visit. Do not build grade computation logic
  on assumptions. See the Blocked section in CLAUDE.md.

## When starting work

State plainly what already exists and what does not before proposing
anything. If a file, endpoint, or column is not in the repo, say so rather
than assuming it is there.

## When finishing work

Update the CURRENT STATE section of `CLAUDE.md` and add a dated row to
`docs/CHANGELOG.md` (the CHANGELOG table moved there on 2026-09-18; the
long text behind the other sections lives in the `docs/` companion files
listed in CLAUDE.md's COMPANION DOCUMENTS section). Keep `CLAUDE.md`
under 150k chars — never delete to make room. List endpoints, not
percentages. If a module has tables but no handlers, it is
not started.
